# Git Workflow Rules

Before changing files, inspect:

```bash
git status
git branch
```

If on `main` or `dev`, create a task branch from `dev`:

```bash
git checkout dev
git pull origin dev
git checkout -b ai/YYYYMMDD-task-name
```

One branch = one task = one PR.

Do not force push, reset hard, clean files, or push directly to main/dev.
